leaves `gamma1IntegralSpan` and `heckePrimeIntegralToRational`) is proved outright by
`eigenformCoeffFieldFinite_proof` (`ZInQKernel/Contrib/OneProof/EigenformCoeffFieldFiniteProof.lean`, from Tau Ceti's
